      "anchor": "summary#list-1",
      "kind": "list",
      "label": "Summary",
      "excerpt": "Each standing team and event in an org gets a public space and a private space,",
      "text": "Make these sub-bullet:\n- Members can read anything public in the organization, can make new posts/comments and can edit  their own contributions.\n- Private spaces are only accessible to the Leads in that space.  They can create new pages or install apps in the public or private space, can delete (but not edit) anyone's posts/comments/etc.  \n- Leads also manage members in the public/private spaces, and can bestow the Lead status to any current Member.",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-01T20:04:31.461Z",
      "status": "new",
      "quote": "Everyone in the org is a Member of its public spaces, and a private space holds only its Leads.",
      "offset": 351,
      "edited": "2026-11-01T20:09:21.011Z"
    },
